WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Choose a workspace. Only permitted documents are searched.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Upload and version private documents. Processing status is visible.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Ask a question about the synthetic company policies.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Complete citation-checked claims arrive while generation continues.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The final answer cites its sources and shows their update dates.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Open a numbered citation to inspect the highlighted quotation.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Inspect document versions, extracted passages and the retained original.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Staff use a separate application with a dedicated employee login.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Support sessions require a reason and are audited. Client accounts have no staff access.
